@startuml
title Strijder product family and responsibility boundaries
top to bottom direction
skinparam backgroundColor #0B0B0F
skinparam defaultFontColor #F4F1E8
skinparam ArrowColor #C89B3C
skinparam packageBorderColor #C89B3C
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #14151B
skinparam componentBorderColor #D8C184
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #1B1D25
skinparam componentFontColor #F4F1E8

package "Strijder" {
  component "Strijder Vision\nVehicle platform" as Vision
  component "Vision Pro EVS\nIntegrated emergency-vehicle system" as Pro
  component "Cadmium CAD\nDispatch + in-vehicle MDT" as Cadmium
}

Vision --> Pro : high-compute configuration
Pro --> Cadmium : integrates

note right of Vision
  Recording and evidence
  Vehicle diagnostics
  Operator authentication
  Offline operation
  Optional cloud administration
end note

note right of Pro
  NVIDIA/Linux Vision Core
  Cameras and operator head
  Windows/CAD display
  Lighting and interlock interfaces
end note

note right of Cadmium
  CAD only
  Calls, units, statuses
  Maps, routing, messaging
end note
@enduml
